  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "See what waits",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A request for you shows in <strong>Inbox</strong> under <strong>For you</strong>. Tap it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5e082b63d0b0f6fc.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Select the request",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>It opens selected and the map moves to its mark. Tap <strong>Assign</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1ff224b202f57aae.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick a team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Teams that can fly it come first, with their drones. Tap one.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c7f5e2ed12508af1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Confirm",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Nothing is sent yet. Tap <strong>Assign to 2R/1J</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/22fc4c4fdcb371f1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See it with the team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For 5 seconds, the line under <strong>Requests</strong> says what you did. The request waits under <strong>With a team</strong> until the team plans it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9e835d6ce0f4f48e.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Give it to another team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>To move it, tap it under <strong>With a team</strong>, then <strong>Change team</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b8b8968d08becb16.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick the new team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick a team and confirm, as before. <strong>‹</strong> leaves it with 2R/1J.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9cc7a4e0382b95ad.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
